xiigen-open-llm is the trainable core of the XIIGen ecosystem: from-scratch
models, DPO/LoRA training, and orchestration, implemented in pure C#. Its
sibling project XIIGen (xiigen-mvp) is the application layer that collects
and cleans the training signal and consumes finished manifests; it does not
train model weights itself.

Third-party components are listed in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.
